{"title": "Status properties/DisableInteractions", "pageid": 35227, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/DisableInteractions", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>DisableInteractions</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_DisableInteractions\">List of conditions with DisableInteractions</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Otiluke's_Resilient_Sphere\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Otiluke%27s_Resilient_Sphere_(Condition)\" title=\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere (Condition)\">Otiluke's Resilient Sphere</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected creature is enclosed in an arcane sphere and can neither be damaged by attacks or effects from outside the sphere, nor can it damage anything outside the sphere. The affected creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is halved.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715165941\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 315/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5480/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1062/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 485486/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   18.613      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   18.613      1 -total\n 50.46%    9.393      1 Template:ConditionsTableRow\n 46.89%    8.728      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 45.26%    8.425      1 Template:Icon_link\n 43.58%    8.111      1 Template:Icon_text\n 38.27%    7.124      2 Template:Trim\n 33.01%    6.145      1 Template:Ifempty\n 18.60%    3.462      1 Template:PageSeo\n 16.99%    3.163      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35227-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715165941 and revision id 330628. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}